  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Brush the dolsot stone bowl with sesame oil and place on a baking sheet.",
    "In a small saucepan, combine miso paste, gochujang, rice vinegar, and 1 tsp of water to make a dressing.",
    "Add the crushed digestive biscuits to the saucepan and stir to combine.",
    "Add the brown rice to the saucepan and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the saucepan mixture to the dolsot stone bowl and smooth the top.",
    "Sprinkle the smoked Gouda over the top of the rice mixture.",
    "Place the dolsot stone bowl in the oven and cook for 10 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Remove the dolsot stone bowl from the oven and sprinkle with Korean chili flakes.",
    "Garnish with sliced green onions and toasted sesame seeds.",
    "Serve immediately."
  ],
